-- 066: Phase 4 — multi-standard views (LLD_PHASE4_STANDARDS).
-- LIFECYCLE REPLAY, not a bootstrap (the 064 precedent): the ACC-05 pair
-- was created, bound, review-approved and ACTIVATED, and both map sets
-- were authored and ratified DRAFT->REVIEW->APPROVED->ACTIVE, through
-- knowledge/rule_lifecycle.py with a real actor on the verification DB;
-- this migration replays that outcome so production reaches the same
-- state at MIGRATE-FIRST time. Transcript: VERIFICATION_PHASE4.md.
--
-- Adds NO claims, NO verdicts, NO runs: a standard is a read-time
-- projection (proven empirically — claim ids, verdict rows and the
-- release run-set hash are byte-identical across landing and removal).
-- Idempotent.
BEGIN;

